# func/date/dt_date (id 345): DATE, and the finish and entry phases of EDATE and EOMONTH. One step per phase.
# PC 0 DATE: A = year, B = month, C = day -> A = serial or error; return LR, LP.
# PC 3 EDATE entry, PC 4 EOMONTH entry: A = start, B = months. Saves LR, LP in T9, T10, calls dt_ymd (344)
#   with T0 = 0, LR = 345, LP = 1 (EDATE) or 2 (EOMONTH).
